# V1a: the single-card V5 byte gate under the watcher at a REDUCED scope (selftest, p0, the negative controls, regimes R1 and RA, one seed): card M alone, the production base image as the runtime, the V5 modules mounted from THIS checkout.
# The earlier run (v345, run 37109438431) died on 'Graph specified in MGD could not fit'; fixed in the harness by QWEN_C2_SERVING=0 and an unset mesh descriptor (c01955d5; the K64j one-card runs passed with it on 10-04). READ: the gate can never PASS at a reduced scope (exit 4, NO-DECISION), so V1a PASSES only on 'GDN_V5 verdict=NO-DECISION scope=reduced' with bytes=0, a final JSON line whose problems hold only 'reduced scope: ...' entries, and no watcher error/assert line in the console or the run log.
# Any other outcome stops the V5 block (V1b does not run). Estimate ~30 min; the workflow's cardm step is killed at 140 min (the harness's own timeout is 3 h); the per-call watchdog exits 3 on a hang: then reset THE TARGET CARD only (the driver's hand-back resets all four).
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the BASELINE window (README.md and ORDER.txt hold the window; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/baseline-window and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN (ORDER.txt has each job's tag). Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards
# are resolved at run time. The window runs ONLY on today's production ENGINE: every job serves the production base image tp4-serve-10 (the engine bytes are production's; production's thin layer on top of it is NOT exercised) and the production profile family
# c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix (the -audit twin where a gate needs the extent audit: the same engine and env plus audit flags). No window image is built. No job here moves :latest or places a model.
C2_CARDS=pair
C2_ACTIONS=cardm
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-10
C2_CARDM_HARNESS=optimisation/ttnn-op/v5split/run_card_m.sh
C2_CARDM_ARGS=--sections selftest,p0,negative --regimes R1,RA --seeds 17 --other-seeds 17
C2_CARDM_ENV=IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-10 WATCHER=1
